+    Phase C0.0 keying-bug fix — the emitted-source stash (``_variant_macros``,
+    the polyhedral feeder, the synth/polyhedral stamps) and the winner-swap in
+    ``build_jit`` MUST agree on the same key, or the swap silently no-ops and a
+    GENERATED winner ships a TEMPLATE build under its validated timing (the
+    exact #16/P0-3 false-green these gates exist to stop).
